<title>HUNGARY: FORECAST - Hungary T-bill yields seen mostly up.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Hungary T-bill yields seen mostly up.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields on most of Hungary's discount Treasury bills are expected to rise at this week's auctions, traders said.</p>
<p>The Government Debt Management Agency (AAKK) will hold a one-month Treasury bill auction on Tuesday, a three-month one on Wednesday, a six-month auction on Thursday and a 12-month auction on Friday.</p>
<p>			    1-MONTH    3-MONTH    6-MONTH    12-MONTH</p>
<p>Amount on offer</p>
<p>  (bln forints)	    1	    5	   14	    14</p>
<p>Previous average(pct)   22.34	22.38	22.47	 22.41</p>
<p>Valid bid range(pct)    +1/-2    +0.5/-2    +0.5/-2     +0.5/-2</p>
<p>FORECASTS OF HUNGARIAN TRADERS</p>
<p>Istvan Halasz, Bank Austria-GiroCredit</p>
<p>    AVERAGE		 22.30	22.45	22.85	 22.80</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM		 22.50	22.65	22.90	 22.91</p>
<p>Gyula Kerdo, Creditanstalt Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE		 22.36	22.43	22.64	 22.68</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM		 22.53	22.55	22.69	 22.91</p>
<p>Zsolt Bango, Gog Securities</p>
<p>    AVERAGE		 22.34	22.47	22.72	 22.85</p>
<p>    MAXIMUM		 22.40	22.55	22.78	 22.90</p>
<p>-- Denes Albert, Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
